Building the Omalauncher APK is allowed. Installing, uninstalling, or clearing it on a
device is forbidden — an uninstall deletes `filesDir`, which holds the Arch Linux rootfs
and all the owner's Linux data. Forbidden: `:app:installDebug`, `:app:installRelease`,
`adb install`, `adb install-multiple`, `adb push` of an APK, `adb uninstall dev.omalauncher`,
`adb shell pm uninstall|clear dev.omalauncher`. Allowed: reading/editing sources,
`:app:assembleDebug|Release`, `:app:bundle*`, `:app:compileDebugKotlin`, `./gradlew build`,
`./scripts/fetch-proot.sh`, `./gradlew :owl:test :app:testDebugUnitTest`, `./gradlew :owl:owlJar`.
See AGENTS.md and docs/BUILD-AND-INSTALL.md for the full rule and rationale.
